    <name>JALUR 7K - JUNIOR PAWITRA</name>
    <desc>Jarak:7,25-+ / EG: 835-+
..........................................
Start &amp; Finish : Halaman Parkir
Warung Lesehan Sri Rahayu
..........................................
JL.Candi Jolotundo, Seloliman Trawas Kab.Mojokerto
..........................................
Destinasi Lintas Candi
1. Candi Bugrek
2. Candi Kursi &amp; Goa Kursi
3. Goa Biyung
4. Candi Kama 3
5. Candi Kendalisodo
6. Puncak Bekel  ( CP-1 )
7. Candi Pura
8.Lembah Giri
9. Candi Putri
10. Watu Talang
11. Candi Bayi</desc>
